The notices of the parts made by others, among them the mingw-w64 runtime
in the host DLLs, are in ThirdParty.txt.

The source code of this release is in Source/. Left out are Warp3D.h and
Warp3D.fd, the Warp3D API includes, (C) 1998 Sam Jordan, Hans-Joerg
Frieden and Thomas Frieden, which are not under the LGPL: building needs
them from QuarkTex's original repository, as
Source/Warp3D.library/Warp3D-includes.txt explains. Amigamesa.h is from
Mesa 1.2, (C) 1995 Brian Paul, LGPL v2 or later. Building minigl.library
needs MiniGL's SDK, (C) Hyperion under the Hyperion MiniGL Open Source
License, which is not included.

