History
-------

1.0beta2  minigl.library moved to MiniGL's 29 SDK (PiStorm3D 29.1): lighting,
          normal arrays, a GLU and GLUT subset. Programs built on an older
          MiniGL SDK need recompiling against the 29 SDK.
1.0beta   First release of QuarkTex NG.
